{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.LiftingDescent.tm_eigenspace_decomp","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.tm_eigenspace_decomp","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.LiftingDescent.JetProlongation"],"declarations":9,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.tm_eigenspace_decomp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.tm_eigenspace_decomp","kind":"theorem","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent/tm_eigenspace_decomp.lean#L65-L88","doc":"**Lemma** (manuscript `lem:topological-mass-eigenspace-decomp`).\n\nLet `α` be the integrand of the mass identity for a vortex `ϱ` and let\n`τ̂ₙ` be the descent involution. Killing-form orthogonality of\n`𝒜_{n+1}^desc ⊕ 𝒜_{n+1}^trans` together with multiplicative-integral\nadditivity over orthogonal direct sums gives\n\n    ‖MI(α)‖ = ‖MI(α_desc)‖ + ‖MI(α_trans)‖.\n\nThe proof rewrites `α` by the *proved* jet-chain decomposition and then\napplies the additivity law at the orthogonality hypothesis. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:lem:topological-mass-eigenspace-decomp","label":"lem:topological-mass-eigenspace-decomp","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/topological-mass-eigenspace-decomp.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.TmEigenspaceDecompContext.mi_additive","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.TmEigenspaceDecompContext.mi_additive","kind":"theorem","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent/tm_eigenspace_decomp.lean#L61-L61","doc":"**Multiplicative-integral additivity** over Killing-orthogonal\nsums: `MI` is additive on any pair that pairs to zero. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.TmEigenspaceDecompContext.killing_orthogonal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.TmEigenspaceDecompContext.killing_orthogonal","kind":"theorem","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent/tm_eigenspace_decomp.lean#L56-L56","doc":"**Killing-form orthogonality** of `𝒜^desc` and `𝒜^trans` at the\nintegrand: the descended and transient parts of `α` pair to zero. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.TmEigenspaceDecompContext.alpha","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.TmEigenspaceDecompContext.alpha","kind":"def","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent/tm_eigenspace_decomp.lean#L53-L53","doc":"The mass-identity integrand `α = (∇_A q, L ∧ F⁺)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.TmEigenspaceDecompContext.MI","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.TmEigenspaceDecompContext.MI","kind":"def","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent/tm_eigenspace_decomp.lean#L51-L51","doc":"The multiplicative-integral norm functional `x ↦ ‖MI(x)‖`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.TmEigenspaceDecompContext.killing","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.TmEigenspaceDecompContext.killing","kind":"def","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent/tm_eigenspace_decomp.lean#L49-L49","doc":"The Killing form on the level-`level + 1` endomorphism algebra. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.TmEigenspaceDecompContext.level","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.TmEigenspaceDecompContext.level","kind":"def","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent/tm_eigenspace_decomp.lean#L47-L47","doc":"The brane-tower level at which the decomposition is taken. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.TmEigenspaceDecompContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.TmEigenspaceDecompContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent/tm_eigenspace_decomp.lean#L41-L41","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.TmEigenspaceDecompContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.TmEigenspaceDecompContext","kind":"class","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent/tm_eigenspace_decomp.lean#L38-L62","doc":"Context for the `tm_eigenspace_decomp` claim: a jet-chain level, a\nKilling form and a multiplicative-integral norm on that level, the mass\nintegrand, and the two manuscript hypotheses relating them. ","signatureChunk":0}]}